{title: 414 - Fruitful Trees, the Spirit's Sowing}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #414 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 414}
{meta: category Doctrines - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]Fruitful trees, theSpirit's [Dm]sowing, [C]May [G/B]we [Am]ripen [Dm/F]and [Am]increase,
[G7/F]Fruit [Em]to [Dm]life [F/C]e [G7/B]ternal growing, [Am]Rich [C7/A#]in [Am]love [F]and [C/G]joy [G7]and [C]peace.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[C]Laden branches [G7]freely [Em/G]bearing
[C]Gifts the Giver [G7]loves [Em/G]to [Am]bless;
[G7/F]Here [Em]is [F/C]fruit [Am]that [G7]grows [C7/A#]by [F]sharing,
[G7/F]Patience, kindness, [Am]gentleness.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[C]Rooted deep [Em]in [G7]Christ, [G/B]our [Em/G]Master,
[C]Christ, our [F]pattern [C]and [Am]our [Dm/F]goal,
[G7/F]Teach [Em]us, [F/C]as [Am]the [G7]years [C7/A#]fly [F]faster,
[G7/F]Goodness, faith, and [Am]self control.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[C]Fruitful trees, [Em]the [G7]Spirit's [Em/G]tending,
[C]May we [F]grow [Dm]till [C]harvests [Dm/F]cease;
[G7/F]Till [Em]we [F/C]taste, [Am]in [G7]life [C7/A#]unending,
[G7/F]Heaven's love and [Am]joy and [C/G]peace.
{end_of_verse}
